   a. IF (P_avel >10 OR P_angle < -3) → Move Right (Action: 2)
   b. ELSE IF (P_avel <-10 OR P_angle >3) → Move Left (Action: 1)
   c. ELSE → Move Right (Action: 2)

### Summary

- **Move Left:** When cart is too far right or to stabilize when pole velocity is low and tilt angle is high.
- **Move Right:** When cart is too far left or as a default stabilization for high positive velocity and negative tilt.

This structured approach ensures the system efficiently navigates without exceeding boundaries while maintaining balance.
